      "handled": "asked",
      "evidence": "Their descriptions are currently too brief to support detailed claims. FraudShield needs context on how detection worked and how it was evaluated."
    },
    {
      "id": "autopilot-is-a-script",
      "handled": "asked",
      "evidence": "AutoPilot needs a concrete example of an analytics task it automates. These sections should grow from those answers."
